stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> building: full build starts
    building --> active: published<br/>pointer compare-and-swap
    building --> failed: build error<br/>or pointer moved
    building --> abandoned: builder instance<br/>expired
    active --> active: incremental<br/>updates
    active --> retiring: newer generation<br/>published
    retiring --> retired: no readers, no leases,<br/>generation_retention passed
    retired --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    abandoned --> [*]
